"- Text Refiner (R)\n"
"- Describe Object (V) / Full Screen (O)\n"
"- Video Analysis (Shift+V)\n"
"- Local Video Recording (Control+V)\n"
"- Document Reader (D)\n"
"- File OCR (F)\n"
"- CAPTCHA Solver (C)\n"
"- Direct Chat (Shift+C)\n"
"- Media Transcription & Dubbing (M)\n"
"- Smart Dictation (S)\n"
